## The results

### "A Soda That Sits at the Grown-Ups' Table."

Alchemy Brew has successfully carved out a "Luxury Refreshment" niche.

**Shelf Disruption:** The cream cans act as a visual "quiet zone" on the shelf, drawing the eye away from the chaotic noise of competitor brands.

**Wellness Appeal:** By highlighting ingredients like Turmeric and Ginger on the front of the pack, the design communicates the "Healthy Twist" instantly.

**Premium Perception:** The "Etched" visual language allows the brand to command a higher price point, positioning the drink as an "Elixir" rather than a mere soda. It is a brand that invites the consumer to "Taste the Magic".

